# ...but HR's schema is hand-applied SQL we need in history, not CLI state. The
# parent dir has to be un-excluded first: git will not descend into an excluded
# directory, so negating only the files inside it has no effect.
!apps/flipper_hr/supabase/
!apps/flipper_hr/supabase/migrations/
!apps/flipper_hr/supabase/migrations/*.sql

